stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--line-dark\" href=\"{{url:/contact/}}\">Summit &amp; Events<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"bda497c7","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"status.mandatory-note","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"7072a0a7","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap\" data-el=\"status.mandatory-note\" data-el-build=\"elementor\" style=\"padding-top:56px\"><p class=\"note\" role=\"note\">This is a strategic relationship with the Global AI Standards Body. No accreditation, exclusivity or course availability is claimed beyond approved language, and no GAISB logo or brand mark is published pending written permission. Programs, territories, certifications, fees and dates appear only once contractually approved.</p></section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"6dfae1a7","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"page.list-primary","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"3eadddc1","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section\" data-el=\"page.list-primary\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"section-head reveal\" style=\"align-items:start\"><h2 class=\"h2\">Priority pathways.</h2><p class=\"body-lg muted\">Eight pathways within the confirmed scope of the relationship.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"hairline list-cells\" style=\"--min:255px\" data-stagger ><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><span>AI literacy</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><span>Professional certification</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><span>Educator and youth learning</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">04</span><span>Sport technology</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">05</span><span>Responsible-AI governance</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">06</span><span>Workforce readiness</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">07</span><span>Enterprise innovation</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">08</span><span>Community capacity building</span></div></div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"7e07709c","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"page.blocks","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"2c151a86","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"band--cream\" data-el=\"page.blocks\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2 mb-l reveal\" style=\"max-width:26ch\">AI supports the pillars. It does not replace them.</h2>\n    <div class=\"hairline\" style=\"--min:260px\" data-stagger>\n      <div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Athlete development</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Analysis and planning tools support coaching decisions. The coach makes the decision.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Inclusive learning</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Assistive and adaptive tools widen access to material. They do not substitute for a teacher or a support worker.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Neurodivergent support</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Tools chosen for accessibility and predictability, reviewed with the people who use them.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">04</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Operations</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Scheduling, reporting and administration, so staff time goes to participants rather than paperwork.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">05</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Media and career preparation</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Production and career-readiness skills that reflect how the work is actually done now.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"3e78f055","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"gaisb.event","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"31794f66","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section event-section\" data-el=\"gaisb.event\" data-el-build=\"custom-widget\">\n  <div class=\"section-head reveal\"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">GAISB event</p><h2 class=\"h2\">GAISB AI World Summit 2027.</h2><p class=\"body-lg muted\">Hosted in Port of Spain by AFSV VRC with the Global AI Standards Body. <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"{{url:/events/}}\">All events <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a></p></div>\n  \n<article class=\"event event--gaisb\" data-el=\"gaisb.event-card\" data-el-build=\"custom-widget\">\n  <div class=\"event__date\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <span class=\"event__day\">29</span>\n    <span class=\"event__month\">Apr</span>\n    <span class=\"event__end\">– 1 May 2027</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"event__main\">\n    <p class=\"event__wordmark\"><small>Port of Spain, Trinidad &amp; Tobago · April 29 – May 1, 2027</small></p>\n    <h3 class=\"event__title\"><a href=\"https://gaisb.ai/port-of-spain.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GAISB AI World Summit 2027<span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens the summit website in a new tab)</span></a></h3>\n    <p class=\"event__headline\"><span>AI is moving money.</span> The rules are being written now.</p>\n    <ul class=\"event__themes\"><li>Work</li><li>Wealth</li><li>Security</li><li>Nations</li><li>Humanity</li></ul>\n    <p class=\"event__summary\">AI is joining the workforce. Money is going digital. AI agents now connect the two. Three days in Port of Spain for the people shaping what comes next: CEOs and executives, governments and regulators, financial professionals, investors and builders.</p>\n    <p class=\"event__where\"><strong>April 29 – May 1, 2027</strong> · Hyatt Regency Trinidad, Port of Spain, Trinidad &amp; Tobago</p>\n    <div class=\"btn-row btn-row--stack\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn--gold event__cta\" href=\"https://gaisb.ai/port-of-spain.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Secure your place<span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens the summit website in a new tab)</span><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 14v6H4V6h6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn--line-light event__cta2\" href=\"https://gaisb.ai/port-of-spain.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">See the agenda<span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 14v6H4V6h6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></a>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"event__host\">Hosted in the Caribbean by AFSV VRC Global Development Group Ltd., Canada.</p>\n  </div>\n  <aside class=\"event__side\">\n    <p class=\"event__side-label\">Summit opens in</p>\n    <div class=\"countdown\" data-countdown=\"2027-04-29T09:00:00-04:00\" role=\"timer\" aria-label=\"Countdown to GAISB AI World Summit 2027\">\n      <div class=\"countdown__cell\"><span class=\"countdown__num\" data-unit=\"days\">--</span><span class=\"countdown__label\">Days</span></div><div class=\"countdown__cell\"><span class=\"countdown__num\" data-unit=\"hours\">--</span><span class=\"countdown__label\">Hours</span></div><div class=\"countdown__cell\"><span class=\"countdown__num\" data-unit=\"mins\">--</span><span class=\"countdown__label\">Minutes</span></div><div class=\"countdown__cell\"><span class=\"countdown__num\" data-unit=\"secs\">--</span><span class=\"countdown__label\">Seconds</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <dl class=\"event__facts\"><div><dt>3 days</dt><dd>of keynotes, roundtables and sessions</dd></div><div><dt>50+</dt><dd>countries expected among delegates</dd></div><div><dt>Jan 31, 2027</dt><dd>speaker submissions close</dd></div></dl>\n  </aside>\n</article>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"7f847957","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"page.interest-form","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"d1f2df47","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section data-form-id=\"gaisb-ai-interest\" class=\"wrap section \" id=\"interest\" data-el=\"page.interest-form\" data-el-build=\"plugin\">\n  <div class=\"split split--form\">\n    <div class=\"form-intro reveal\">\n      <h2 class=\"h2\">Certification, education and enterprise inquiries.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-lg\">Tell us which pathway applies and we will route your inquiry to the right team.</p>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">No certification, fee, territory or date is confirmed by this form. Responses describe approved scope only.</p>\n    </div>\n    \n<form class=\"form\" data-preview-form>\n  <p class=\"small muted\">Fields marked <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--danger)\">*</span><span class=\"sr-only\">with an asterisk</span> are required.</p>\n  <div class=\"form__grid\">\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f98\">Name<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f98\" name=\"name\" aria-describedby=\"f98-err\" required aria-required=\"true\" placeholder=\"Full name\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f98-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f99\">Organization<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f99\" name=\"organization\" aria-describedby=\"f99-err\" required aria-required=\"true\" placeholder=\"Organization name\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f99-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f100\">Role<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f100\" name=\"role\" aria-describedby=\"f100-err\" required aria-required=\"true\" placeholder=\"Your role\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f100-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f101\">Email<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"email\" id=\"f101\" name=\"email\" aria-describedby=\"f101-err\" required aria-required=\"true\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f101-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f102\">Phone <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <input type=\"tel\" id=\"f102\" name=\"phone\" aria-describedby=\"f102-err\" placeholder=\"Optional\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f102-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f103\">Country<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f103\" name=\"country\" aria-describedby=\"f103-err\" required aria-required=\"true\" placeholder=\"Country\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f103-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f104\">Pathway<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f104\" name=\"pathway\" aria-describedby=\"f104-err\" required aria-required=\"true\"><option value=\"\">Please select</option><option value=\"AI literacy\">AI literacy</option><option value=\"Professional certification\">Professional certification</option><option value=\"Educator and youth learning\">Educator and youth learning</option><option value=\"Sport technology\">Sport technology</option><option value=\"Responsible-AI governance\">Responsible-AI governance</option><option value=\"Workforce readiness\">Workforce readiness</option><option value=\"Enterprise innovation\">Enterprise innovation</option><option value=\"Community capacity building\">Community capacity building</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f104-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f105\">Learner or team size <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f105\" name=\"learner-or-team-size\" aria-describedby=\"f105-err\"><option value=\"\">Please select<